{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫小花陳熙蕊近日請假返美國探親兩個星期，笑言在當日聽得最多是「Excuse me」。</p><p>試過有日她拍Reels時不斷轉圈，點知有人好認真問她：「Excuse me, can you stop？</p><p>」她說朋友覺得對方有點不禮貌，但自己只會一笑置之。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T06:23:57.406971+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T06:01:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T06:18:08.950739+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T06:18:08.950739+00:00","content_hash":"7208df76f552bb5b8861ab7091bed04197a47443a6b78f1b18452d132d39db36","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}